        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_736_1865.JPG" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frünttlich</unclear> willig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dienpst</unclear> sampt was wir eren liebs
<lb n="2"/>und guots <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermoegen</unclear> zuovor, fromen fürsichtigen und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wüsen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">insunders</unclear>
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guot</unclear> fründ und getrüwen lieben <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eidgnon</unclear></orgName>. Es ist uff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hüt</unclear> vor
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> erschinen der ersam und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bescheiden</unclear> unser lieber und getrüwer burger <persName resp="#ner">Niclaus
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Brunschwüller</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeiger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dß</unclear> brieffs, und hatt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angezöugt</unclear> wie das sines vatters
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">säligen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muotter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tastamentt</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemächts</unclear> gethon <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">namlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">einer</unclear> genantt <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Barball</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Brunschwuellerin</unclear></persName> so by üch in üwer statt gewont und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abgestorben</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ist</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alls</unclear> er
<lb n="8"/>üch das alles <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mündttlich</unclear> woll <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anzoügen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kan</unclear>, und so nun gemeltter sin vatter
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sälig</unclear> so genantt ist <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Balthus</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Brunschwüller</unclear></persName> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehelicher</unclear> sun er ist, <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Balthus</unclear></persName> von
<lb n="10"/>siner <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muotter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entterbt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sije</unclear> so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nitt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">billich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waere</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">also</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söllich</unclear> guot durch gemeltte,
<lb n="11"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Barball</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Brunschwüllerin</unclear></persName> an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ortt</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">end</unclear> ouch vermachet <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dßselbige</unclear> guots aber er
<lb n="12"/>der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">recht</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nägst</unclear> erb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sije</unclear>. So hatt er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frünttliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürgschrifft</unclear> an üch
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gepetten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deren</unclear> er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verhofft</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wolle</unclear> zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geniessen</unclear> das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söllich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmächt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffgehept</unclear> und ime
<lb n="14"/>söllich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guottly</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuogesteltt</unclear> werde wie das billich und er der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">recht</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nägst</unclear> erb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sije</unclear>
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welichs</unclear> wir im <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nüt</unclear> abschlahen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">koenen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diewil</unclear> er deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nottürfftig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sije</unclear>.
<lb n="16"/>Uff söllichs getrüwen lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eidgnon</unclear> so ist unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frünttlich</unclear> pitt und beger an üch
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear> den unsern verhoeren und ime <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">günstegklich</unclear> zuo dem rechten und zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söllichem</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>erb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhelffen</unclear> ime lassen bevolhen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sijn</unclear>, das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stadt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> umb üch und die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üweren</unclear>
<lb n="19"/>gantz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frünttlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glichem</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mererm</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ze</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verdienen</unclear>. Datum <origDate when="1554" resp="#ner">mentag nach
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bartolomej</unclear> anno <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">1554</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="21"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schulthes</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rhatt</unclear>
<lb n="22"/>der statt Lucern</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_736_1866.JPG" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_736_1867.JPG" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_736_1868.JPG" n="4"/>
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Denn</unclear> fromen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuersichtigen</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wysen</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rhatt</unclear> der statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sant</unclear> Gallen</orgName>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnsern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innsunders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruenden</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getruewen</unclear>
<lb n="26"/>lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnosen</unclear>.
</p>
